# Disposable-class working documents (doctrine/05-the-record.md).
#
# These are deliberately not deliverables. Because nobody outside will read them they are
# permitted to be blunt, messy, and revised violently — which is what keeps the permanent
# documents clean. Pattern taken from OpenDrop, which excluded its triage and analysis docs
# for exactly this reason.
#
# If one of these starts carrying load, promote it to frozen or living and remove it from
# this list. If you would be upset to lose it, it is not disposable.
/TRIAGE.md
/SCRATCH.md
/NOTES.md
/*.draft.md

